# shell/ia-pinned.list — manually pinned projects for `mesh ia`.
#
# Format: <name>|<path[:alt-path[:...]]>
#  • Engine picks the FIRST existing alt (so one file serves all machines).
#  • '~' expands to $HOME. Non-git dirs are allowed (pinned = explicit).
#  • Reserved chars: | (field)   : (alternate)   # (comment).
#  • `mesh ia add/remove/list` edits this file; the engine only READS it.
#  • A pinned name overrides a discovered repo of the same name (explicit wins).
#
# Example:
# my-project|/Volumes/External/Code/my-project:~/code/my-project
# scratch-kb|~/notes/knowledge-base
